cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: autogeoref
abstract: >-
  Automatic georeferencing for scanned Sanborn fire-insurance maps. A vision
  model reads street labels off a sheet, the labels are matched against
  reference street geometry, and a constrained RANSAC fit is committed only
  where independent evidence gates accept it; sheets that fail remain flagged
  rather than silently placed.
type: software
